    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d15-a15">

                <pb facs="0090" n="70" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg70"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord
                        Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1864-03-11"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 11, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: Recurring to your note of the 4th
                    ultimo, respecting the arrival in Havana of a thousand imported negroes, in
                    which the desire of her Majesty’s government for any information on the subject
                    is signified, I have the honor to enclose a copy of a despatch of the 5th
                    instant from the United States consul general at that port which relates to the
                    matter.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, my lord, your obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWABD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. Lord <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lyons</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c, &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
